slides.prompt:
A vibrant and high-impact title slide that perfectly balances professional photography with a fresh, modern aesthetic. The right side is anchored by a massive green hexagonal frame containing a bright office scene, while the left side uses bold, high-contrast typography to set an energetic and optimistic tone for the presentation. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": {
    "type": "HorizontalSplit",
    "ratio": "50/50",
    "alignment": "center"
  },
  "branding": {
    "logo_icon": "trending-up",
    "logo_shape": "hex",
    "logo_color": "#2ecc71",
    "text": "Growth Solutions"
  },
  "background": {
    "color": "#FFFFFF",
    "right_overlay": { "color": "#2ecc71", "opacity": "0.1", "pattern": "radial-dots", "dot_size": "20px" }
  },
  "typography": {
    "h1_a": { "text": "GROW YOUR", "color": "#2ecc71", "size": "64px", "weight": "900" },
    "h1_b": { "text": "BUSINESS", "color": "#1e272e", "size": "64px", "weight": "900" },
    "accent_bar": { "h": "8px", "w": "96px", "color": "#2ecc71" }
  },
  "visual_elements": {
    "main_hex": {
      "size": "460x400px",
      "border_layers": [ { "offset": "-8px", "color": "#2ecc71", "opacity": "0.3" }, { "bg": "white", "padding": "8px" } ],
      "image_content": "modern_plant_filled_workspace"
    },
    "accent_hexes": [
      { "size": "96px", "color": "#2ecc71", "opacity": "0.2", "pos": "top-right" },
      { "size": "64px", "color": "#1e272e", "opacity": "0.1", "pos": "bottom-center" }
    ]
  }
}

A clean and professional company overview slide utilizing a balanced two-column layout. Fresh green accents define the typography, while two small hexagonal image masks on the right provide a human element through collaborative office photography. The design communicates stability, growth, and a decades-long legacy of success. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "TwoColumnBalanced",
  "typography": {
    "headline": { "size": "32px", "weight": "900", "color": "#1e272e" },
    "body": { "size": "14px", "color": "#4B5563", "border_left": "4px solid #2ecc71" }
  },
  "visuals": {
    "right_stack": [
      { "shape": "hex", "size": "180px", "image": "business_collaboration_1" },
      { "shape": "hex", "size": "180px", "image": "business_collaboration_2" }
    ]
  }
}

A visionary mission statement slide that uses strong directional imagery to communicate purpose. A large, arrow-shaped hexagonal image on the left points toward a detailed list of strategic goals, creating a clear narrative link between the company's vision and its execution strategy. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "40/60VerticalSplit",
  "visuals": {
    "left_mask": { "shape": "hex_arrow_vertical", "size": "480px", "image": "visionary_professional_looking_up" }
  },
  "typography": {
    "headline": { "text": "OUR MISSION", "size": "42px", "weight": "900", "color": "#1e272e" },
    "list_items": {
      "bullet": "hex",
      "bullet_color": "#2ecc71",
      "font": "Bold 18px",
      "spacing": "32px"
    }
  }
}

A networking and connectivity slide that emphasizes the power of global collaboration. A cluster of interconnected hexagonal images sits at the center of the slide, surrounded by soft green geometric patterns that symbolize an integrated and technologically advanced business ecosystem. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "CenteredHexMosaic",
  "background": { "color": "#FFFFFF", "pattern": "hex_grid_soft_green" },
  "mosaic": {
    "center_cluster": 3,
    "hex_size": "220px",
    "overlap": "10%",
    "border": "2px solid #2ecc71"
  },
  "typography": {
    "labels": { "size": "14px", "weight": "Bold", "color": "#1e272e", "pos": "floating_above" }
  }
}

A clean and highly functional roadmap slide that breaks down complex project phases into digestible steps. Three hexagonal icons in varying shades of green define the path from research to deployment, each supported by high-density text that outlines the specific technical and strategic deliverables. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "3ColumnHorizontalRoadmap",
  "bg": "#F3F4F6",
  "columns": [
    { "phase": "RESEARCH", "hex_color": "#A7F3D0", "icon": "search" },
    { "phase": "DEVELOPMENT", "hex_color": "#34D399", "icon": "layers" },
    { "phase": "DEPLOYMENT", "hex_color": "#059669", "icon": "send" }
  ],
  "typography": {
    "phase_font": "Bold 20px #1e272e",
    "list_font": "Medium 12px #6B7280"
  }
}

A professional team showcase slide that humanizes the company's technical mission. Four hexagonal portrait frames house the leadership team, each underlined by a solid green bar that adds a sense of stability and professional grounding to the overall layout. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "4ColumnHexRow",
  "hex_style": {
    "size": "160px",
    "border_bottom": "2px solid #2ecc71"
  },
  "typography": {
    "name": "Black 16px #1e272e",
    "role": "Uppercase 10px #9CA3AF"
  }
}

A strategic overview slide featuring images clipped into a cascading sequence of hexagons. This design creates a sense of forward momentum and growth, while the detailed descriptions of the three primary pillars provide a robust foundation for the company's long-term business strategy. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "CascadingHexagons",
  "visuals": {
    "hex_stack": { "count": 3, "size": "140px", "direction": "diagonal-down" }
  },
  "typography": {
    "numbers": "Outline 32px #D1D5DB",
    "pillars": "Bold 24px #2ecc71",
    "body": "Regular 14px #4B5563"
  }
}

A data-rich analysis slide that emphasizes the company's fiscal strength. A professional bar chart in green and dark grey is balanced by high-contrast metric cards, ensuring that key growth indicators and market penetration data are immediately Digestible for stakeholders. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "DashboardGrid",
  "bg": "#F9FAFB",
  "main_chart": { "type": "Bar", "colors": ["#2ecc71", "#1e272e"] },
  "metric_cards": {
    "count": 3,
    "shape": "hex_blur_bg",
    "value_font": "Black 28px #1e272e",
    "label_font": "Uppercase 12px #9CA3AF"
  }
}

A warm and inviting closing slide that reinforces the deck's fresh and optimistic theme. A large hexagonal image of a modern, collaborative workspace is balanced by clear contact information and vibrant green icons, inviting potential partners to connect and build the future together. DESIGN_SPEC: {
  "layout": "50/50Balanced",
  "visuals": {
    "right_hex": { "size": "340px", "image": "modern_office_interaction" }
  },
  "contact": {
    "icons": ["mail", "phone", "map-pin"],
    "color": "#2ecc71"
  },
  "typography": {
    "closing": "Black 48px #1e272e",
    "accent_period": "#2ecc71"
  }
}
